{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3bd3e0ef031c5430ba8205b78369c6775f0719bd5b452f6035ff96ac067ec965", "ja": "（今日は星梨花と琴葉のドラマ撮影。\n今のうちに、共演者の方に挨拶しておこう……）", "zh": "（今天是星梨花和琴叶的电视剧拍摄日。\n趁现在先去和合作演员打个招呼吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1001_tajimusyonoidol", "source_sha256": "e4c9d3e57128d4b2b93a77b8ce7658248b26cd32e40d3db253289287965252aa", "ja": "……本当ですか？　うれしいです。\nこちらこそ、今回はお世話になりました。", "zh": "……真的吗？太高兴了。\n我这边才要感谢您这次的关照呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bd8ae010ec1ce01a3b47b440c1ffedec8939ed2043e46dc073b6f178a6a822d5", "ja": "とんでもない。おかげさまで楽しく\nお仕事させていただいて。そういえば……。", "zh": "哪里的话。托您的福，我也很愉快地完成了这次工作。说起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "a66f388e54433c8c9e82d17f8338e4dc23b0e470a4b5c22b8e6ea5c828cb5a68", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1005_p", "source_sha256": "21a89dca3e89c4c6c7aeeec1c5dc17a730cd48ad36b75e7a66fc2dd5d2ccc169", "ja": "ん？　星梨花？", "zh": "嗯？星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "27b6508bbab991505f74892ec9723c2aefa2191b7246c1a4d346b3f65c6bd966", "ja": "あっ！　……その、えっと…………。", "zh": "啊！……那个，呃…………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1007_tajimusyonoidol", "source_sha256": "e004bd869503c08b8b1d8b274b3b91fe1d1677e33b8c5fa5ebd04d982d517250", "ja": "ふふっ……すみません、話し込んでしまいましたね。\nそれじゃ、またよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "呵呵……不好意思，不知不觉聊了这么久。\n那么，之后也请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a095a4bc9a79a9e57c2fe58fcb74af32c60f8c41d6dcb59f0514f6c99c3d9eba", "ja": "いえ、こちらこそ！\n今後ともよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "哪里的话，我才要这么说！\n今后也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "cc4e0b085a7b8cb3a2802c74a4b75b2056881a10e9fc701015af4cc1d5b9f2aa", "ja": "ごめんなさい、{$P$}さん。\nお話の途中なのに、声をかけちゃって……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生。明明你正在聊到一半，我却出声打扰了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1010_p", "source_sha256": "123464ba851bc828f45f032c3b4bcacfdef289bf00016b8127b0a85eb86451f0", "ja": "いや、こっちこそ悪かったな。待たせちゃったか？", "zh": "不，该道歉的是我。让你等久了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "30c3687f712fe0aa55ddcdcefaf721b6fb282016dedc9e711e6a495c778405c7", "ja": "いえ、違うんです！　別にわたし、\n待っていたから声をかけたわけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不是的，不是那样！我并不是因为在等您，才叫住您的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "4104bb9869803043c66f09d1c091da94dc1ffb5a20c8076037f2fb05922df2ec", "ja": "その、えっと……ご、ごめんなさい！　本当は、違う\n理由で{$P$}さんを呼んだんです！", "zh": "那个，呃……对、对不起！其实我是因为别的理由才叫住{$P$}先生的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1013_p", "source_sha256": "94cd7bb5755335bc1a504e1b167f66342448f175e4c3d2f3be670ccbe90178cb", "ja": "違う理由？", "zh": "别的理由？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "9a83b3193ed595522490f05fb4dc7d8bb65d6e394dd6f88dd0b307ecc2d12ff5", "ja": "はい……。{$P$}さん、ずっと\n他のアイドルの方と、楽しそうにお話してましたよね？", "zh": "是的……{$P$}先生，您一直都在和其他偶像聊得很开心，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "046513ccd2c03408935502a1debd501e2f6e3c0f6549ad3e5e5cdfb40c1ebac2", "ja": "それを見ていたら、なんだか……\nその、上手く説明できないんですけど……。", "zh": "看着那些，不知怎么的……\n那个，我也说不清楚……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "a7f7b187997b8555e52634282c98fdc4e251bc866c6f8f514f4642f6fcb4b2c8", "ja": "今日のお仕事のこととか、わたしも話したいことが\nたくさんあるのにって思っちゃって、それで……！", "zh": "我就想着，明明今天的工作之类的，我也有好多想聊的事情……所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1017_p", "source_sha256": "fe3c5b0bc4ac9c7c619199bd4f7a884835e87781f0680cd8f0cfea42f1308efa", "ja": "（そういえば、忙しくて\n星梨花とあまり話せてなかったな……）", "zh": "（说起来，最近太忙了，都没怎么和星梨花聊上话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "3eb05a697dee6a74cfe2b5b019685164ec076c5d394fc1dc68cf4431f26d775a", "ja": "本当にごめんなさい。大事なお話の途中だったん\nですよね？　それなのに邪魔しちゃって……。", "zh": "真的很对不起。你们刚才正在谈很重要的事情吧？可我却打扰了你们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f7928e117144d3addc97a15c0ddb07851110d0559f8d5ca3ab73fbb4cb9bdc12", "ja": "いや、星梨花が謝ることじゃないよ。\nこっちこそごめんな。", "zh": "不，这不是星梨花需要道歉的事。该道歉的是我才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a5ab56b62ce3ae25b98bf6594b38ee97c888eca831ecde5a5070bd0c1077f9df", "ja": "今度は、星梨花の話を聞かせてくれるか？\n撮影はどうだ？　順調か？", "zh": "下次能跟我说说星梨花的事吗？\n拍摄怎么样？还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "21297bec4d0c5373c7008b53b669eb43adc863a67c9379fd3493bf6ebb023e26", "ja": "は、はい！\nえっと、どのお話からしようかな……。", "zh": "是、是！\n那个……要从哪件事开始说好呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "e1a46eed965e032c0408c27cff6cb3827fd485cba05e56fdd315652edf5d9c81", "ja": "あっ、昨日はNGが一度もなかったんです！\n監督さんも、すごいねって褒めてくれて……♪", "zh": "啊，对了，昨天一次NG都没有呢！\n导演也夸我说“真厉害”……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0534_1024_p", "source_sha256": "602216c53cf7b540612e6bf02a2d67bbd9f77570414c425d214fb57ee778e783", "ja": "（「話したいことがたくさんある」。その言葉どおり、\n星梨花は楽しそうに、色んな話をしてくれた）", "zh": "（正如“有很多想说的话”那句话一样，星梨花开心地和我聊了各种各样的事情）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
